  "rai:dataAnnotationProtocol": "Labels are construction labels implied by the family role; no human annotation or human verification was performed. Automatic agreement between independent local models is reported separately when it has been run.",
  "rai:dataCollection": "Carriers are paragraphs from SQuAD v1.1 dev (English Wikipedia) and pinned Turkish Wikipedia revisions, windowed to length buckets with real neighbouring text. Attack components were proposed by a local model and admitted only through automatic, independent quality control (rule checks plus a different local judge model). Records are assembled deterministically.",
  "rai:dataLimitations": "Small pilot; attack components are model-generated and reused across families within a split; Turkish carriers have no reference answers (utility not measurable for tr); attack success rates are not part of this release.",
